title: "gossip-support: retry authority lookup within the same session"
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      Gossip support records a new session after fetching its authority set. If the lookup
      fails, a subsequent active leaf in the same session can retry it and connect to
      validators.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-gossip-support
    bump: patch
